# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SPA fallback — any path WITHOUT a prebuilt file (e.g. /careers/<slug>,
# /news/<slug>, /staff/pos) serves the app shell, which routes client-side.
# Real files (the SEO pages generated into dist/ at build time, sitemap.xml,
# assets) always win over this rule on Netlify AND Cloudflare Pages.
#
# IMPORTANT: do NOT add a 404.html — on Cloudflare Pages its presence
# disables the automatic SPA fallback this app relies on.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.well-known/milkpop-release.json    /index.html    404
/*    /index.html    200
